[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_WHAT_IS_SHE_LIKE]
What’s she like?

[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_WHAT_IS_SHE_LIKE_desc]
Though Derpy is a Duchess of the Empire, and we have known her for a long time, do we really understand her?\nIt seems that we know nothing about her except that she likes muffins... Maybe she is just a simple-minded pony, but it is always good to be skeptical.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_WHAT_IS_SHE_LIKE]
她是谁？

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_WHAT_IS_SHE_LIKE_desc]
虽说呆蹄是帝国的领主，我们也已经熟悉她很久了，但我们真的了解她么？\n似乎除了喜欢杯糕之外，我们对她就一无所知了... 也许她就只是一个头脑简单的小马，但保持多疑总是好的。

